flowchart LR
  User((User)) --> UI[React SPA (Browser)]
  UI -->|Axios + JWT| API[FastAPI Backend]

  API --> Auth[Auth + JWT]
  API --> Wardrobe[Wardrobe: upload, detect, list, search, filter, categories]
  API --> Reco[Recommendations: occasion, pair-with, today]
  API --> ColorHarmony[Color Harmony]
  API --> WeatherSvc[Weather Service]
  API --> WeatherClothing[Weather Clothing]
  API --> ImageServe[Static Image Serving]

  Auth --> DB[(SQLite via SQLAlchemy)]
  Wardrobe --> DB
  Reco --> DB
  ColorHarmony --> DB

  Wardrobe --> FS[(Local File Storage: uploads + profile images)]
  Wardrobe --> ML[Image Analysis: rembg + PIL + MobileNetV2]
  WeatherSvc --> OWM[OpenWeatherMap API]
  WeatherClothing --> OWM
  ImageServe --> FS
